      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="text-moss">Our portfolio covers four kinds of genetic test: monogenic disorders, pharmacogenetic variants, rare genetic disorders and custom molecular diagnostic assays. Tests for nine conditions have been developed so far, across two families of inherited conditions, and more assays are under development: a blood coagulation panel and pharmacogenomics testing among them.</p>
